# pc-ui

This repo is `@miquelt9/pc-ui` — Windows 9x CSS tokens, primitives, and optional React wrappers.

Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md):

- **CSS-first.** Vanilla sites (miquelt9.github.io) get one file: `src/pc-ui.css` via `<link>` or a copied `css/pc-ui.css`. No npm/React/bundler on that site.
- React apps import `@miquelt9/pc-ui/pc-ui.css` plus optional components; React peers are optional.
- After editing `tokens.css` / `primitives.css`, run `npm run build` (regenerates `pc-ui.css`).
- Keep React wrappers presentational (no drag/window manager keybinds)
- Preserve visual tokens; do not reinvent colors or bevels
- Multi-pane fullscreen: `Desktop tiled` + `Workspace` + `Split` + `Window fill` (or the same CSS classes in HTML)
- Bingo: restyle chrome only; keep print/PDF white and non-Win98
